{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22413","headline":"寄微之三首 三 · 白居易","name":"寄微之三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去国日已远，喜逢物似人。\n如何含此意，江上坐思君。\n有如河岳气，相合方氛氲。\n狂风吹中绝，两处成孤云。\n风回终有时，云合岂无因。\n努力各自爱，穷通我尔身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}